	(text "PVDD_TRIM: 2-pole RC 10k/1uF x2 (15.9 Hz); R907 68k + D901 fitted. Hi-Z or 0 V = 18 V, 3.3 V = 12.3 V; trim only lowers PVDD; wait >= 150 ms."
